WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.360 --> 00:00:06.163
<v><b>Amy:</b></v> Twelve thirty. In a long queue outside the Conference Centre in Manchester.

2
00:00:07.223 --> 00:00:09.464
<v><b>Guard:</b></v> Can I see your ID, please?

3
00:00:09.505 --> 00:00:10.985
<v><b>Amy:</b></v> Here’s my passport.

4
00:00:11.365 --> 00:00:17.488
<v><b>Guard:</b></v> Thanks. ‘Amy Jones.’ And I need to check your bag, please.

5
00:00:19.829 --> 00:00:23.631
OK, that’s fine, come in. Next, please!

6
00:00:25.232 --> 00:00:31.135
<v><b>Amy:</b></v> Twelve forty-five. In the waiting area with three hundred and fifty other singers!

7
00:00:32.075 --> 00:00:36.297
<v><b>Organizer 1:</b></v> OK Amy, sit here and wait until we call your name.

8
00:00:36.357 --> 00:00:37.278
<v><b>Amy:</b></v> Thanks.

9
00:00:37.598 --> 00:00:40.059
<v><b>Organizer:</b></v> Are you here for the audition, too?

10
00:00:40.139 --> 00:00:44.541
<v><b>Friend:</b></v> No, I’m not. I’m Amy’s friend. Can I wait with her?

11
00:00:44.571 --> 00:00:45.602
<v><b>Organizer 1:</b></v> Yeah, sure.

12
00:00:45.902 --> 00:00:46.732
<v><b>Friend:</b></v> Thanks.

13
00:00:47.082 --> 00:00:50.124
<v><b>Amy:</b></v> Let’s sit here. I’m so nervous…

14
00:00:50.584 --> 00:00:56.367
<v><b>Organizer 1:</b></v> Matteo Ricci, Jada Jackson, Tony Cash, come with me, please. This way.

15
00:00:56.487 --> 00:00:57.507
<v><b>Amy:</b></v> Good luck!

16
00:01:01.569 --> 00:01:06.832
Four o’clock. Three hours later! My turn at last!

17
00:01:07.952 --> 00:01:15.336
<v><b>Organizer 2:</b></v> Amy Jones, Naomi Williams, Dan Elliot? Can you come with me, please? It’s your turn now.

18
00:01:15.416 --> 00:01:17.467
<v><b>Amy:</b></v> Oh help! It’s my turn.

19
00:01:17.637 --> 00:01:19.938
<v><b>Friend:</b></v> Good luck, Amy! You can do it!

20
00:01:20.228 --> 00:01:23.650
<v><b>Amy:</b></v> Excuse me. Can my friend come with me?

21
00:01:23.920 --> 00:01:27.221
<v><b>Organizer 2:</b></v> No, she can’t. She can wait there.

22
00:01:27.361 --> 00:01:31.764
And you can’t take your bag into the audition. Leave it with your friend.

23
00:01:32.084 --> 00:01:33.144
<v><b>Amy:</b></v> OK.

24
00:01:34.725 --> 00:01:41.248
Four fifteen. In the audition, with two judges. Really nervous!

25
00:01:42.269 --> 00:01:45.750
<v><b>Judge:</b></v> Amy … Jones? What’s your song?

26
00:01:45.910 --> 00:01:47.171
<v><b>Amy:</b></v> <i>One Day</i>.

27
00:01:47.591 --> 00:01:51.153
<v><b>Judge:</b></v> We can’t hear you. Is the microphone on?

28
00:01:51.633 --> 00:01:56.255
<v><b>Amy:</b></v> Sorry. Sorry. Can you hear me now?

29
00:01:56.375 --> 00:01:57.866
<v><b>Judge:</b></v> Yes, that’s fine.

30
00:01:58.086 --> 00:02:00.107
<v><b>Amy:</b></v> My song’s <i>One Day</i>.

31
00:02:00.557 --> 00:02:01.858
<v><b>Judge:</b></v> Can you start, please?

32
00:02:02.598 --> 00:02:06.340
<v><b>Amy:</b></v> Oh no! I can’t remember the first line.

33
00:02:06.520 --> 00:02:07.761
<v><b>Judge:</b></v> Take your time.

34
00:02:09.541 --> 00:02:11.422
<v><b>Amy:</b></v> I’m OK now!